290/extras/f7306381dd89a21bad9a795c1ac28d96.mp4?t=1772912652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate resources between you and the child, find unique items that will influence dialogues and give you new ways to approach different situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to save the child's mother and get them both to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230290/extras/ed18d3680325b07a2c9ab1d52354e783.poster.avif?t=1772912652\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230290/extras/ed18d3680325b07a2c9ab1d52354e783.webm?t=1772912652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230290/extras/ed18d3680325b07a2c9ab1d52354e783.mp4?t=1772912652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you chose the longer and safer paths, or risk to save time and fuel and take the shorter but more dangerous ones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you let the child starve or sacrifice your own well-being for him? Will you be a pretend-hero, a coward or a fuel-drinking madman who refuses to wear clothes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230290/extras/f303e9504ecf651303e5628f0480f8f2.poster.avif?t=1772912652\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230290/extras/f303e9504ecf651303e5628f0480f8f2.webm?t=1772912652\" type=\"video/we